{"server":"cn","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_08_end","groupId":"act51side","stageId":"act51side_08","title":"一千年后","storyCode":"PA-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act51side/level_act51side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"d59d63b44fd797eb19d6a7a08651a0ad75530223237f2d2e2a2aee7a85f3f9c3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在所有人的齐心协力下，伊戈尔雕像轰然倒塌，破碎的雕像在城墙上砸开了一道缺口。巴普洛维奇被打败，学生们突破封锁，冲出了卡托加区。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g9_topwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进！把他们大卸八块！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要节省源石弩箭，打赢了你们人人有赏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒A","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"射击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒A","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是这群疯子，沾上也要脱层皮！给我把他们压死在掩体后面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教官！我们该撤了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"avg_260_durnar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先带伤员走，我掩护你们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒A","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那帮小鬼撑不住了，集中火力对付那个拿盾牌的沃尔珀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒B","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟敢拿着老大的库存对付我们......找死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒C","speakerId":"avg_npc_2167_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为格罗莫夫报仇！"},{"type":"narration","text":"报仇的喊声如山呼海啸，暴徒如潮水般涌来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2181_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅，罗莎琳快撑不住了，我们得过去帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在房子里藏好，她会没事的，一切都在计划内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2181_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们留存的火力超乎想象，如果还获得了外面的补给，我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉住气......相信你的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟随过这片大地上最出色的战术指挥者，我们一定会活着离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2181_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"narration","text":"凛冬深吸一口气，她望着越来越近的人潮，紧紧追在罗莎琳他们的身后。\n坚雷抵抗了一会，也随之转头跑去，而紧跟着她的暴徒们像是一群饥饿的裂兽，争先恐后地挤进了这条只有两个车身宽的狭窄巷道。\n他们完全忽略了脚下那层黏稠的液体，也没注意到头顶两侧那一扇扇紧闭得有些诡异的窗户。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒A","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小毛头们怕了，继续追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯塔尼","speakerId":"avg_4223_botany_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“十六勇士”已经到达目标位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯塔尼","speakerId":"avg_4223_botany_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都做好准备，听我命令。"},{"type":"narration","text":"巷子的尽头，“慌乱逃窜”的坚雷突然停下了脚步。\n她没有回头，只是微微侧身，手中的盾牌轻轻磕在地上，发出一声清脆的“当”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一组、二组，上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"窗户一齐打开，火把与炸药如同雨点般落下。它们没有被胡乱投掷，而是精准地砸在了敌人队伍的中部。\n火苗攀爬上暴徒们单薄的服装，惊怖的叫声顿时此起彼伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从两侧包抄到前方！避开巷子中间的火焰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轮到我们反击了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从破碎的窗户下，从堆满杂物的垃圾箱后，从每一片原本死寂的阴影中，无数个身影站了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们手里拿着钢管、扳手，以及从格罗莫夫那里缴获的奇怪兵器，在怒吼声中冲向了曾经欺压自己的敌人。\n他们原本身着不同的校服，或粗糙或精致，甚至有人套着破旧的棉大衣。但此刻，他们拥有了统一的“军装”。\n在每一个人的胸口，都用油彩画着一个醒目的标志——曾经为了活下去，如今为了扯断枷锁，而握紧的拳头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌拉——"},{"type":"narration","text":"当暴徒们如梦初醒般嚎叫着逃离巷子的包围，迎接他们的是这些愤怒的拳头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个接一个，曾经不可一世的“狱警”，给他们带来侮辱与迫害的暴徒，在他们的挥击下纷纷倒地。\n踏着满地遗留的武器，凛冬走到队伍正前方，望着敌人慌忙逃窜的背影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗组，照看受伤的人，其他人继续前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教官、罗莎琳，你们先在后方休整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅！我没事，你让我——"},{"type":"narration","text":"凛冬走到她的身前，脸上带着不容置疑的、令人感到可靠的微笑，伸出了一个拳头。\n烈夏怔了片刻，她点点头，没有反驳，抬起右手重重地撞上了那个拳头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）干得好，夏将军，一会儿再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同学们跟我冲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胜利就在前方，不要懈怠——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯塔尼","speakerId":"avg_4223_botany_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅，他们退到了自己的阵线范围内，开始还击了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先找掩体，判断下他们的火力强度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯塔尼","speakerId":"avg_4223_botany_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2179_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冬将军！他们还有预备队，我们的右翼被压制住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，我马上过去帮你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先说好了，止完血我还得上去，到时候都别拦着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要逞强，烈夏姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，几处擦伤罢了......等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古米？！你怎么在这——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"avg_196_sunbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！别让凛冬姐听到，她会分心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"avg_196_sunbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想给大家帮点忙，就拜托柳德米拉姐带我进来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"avg_196_sunbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还找了人帮我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉？她也在？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一行人突然出现在前方。\n几乎像是从地下爬出来的，他们人数稀少，却毫不犹豫地扑向了包围右翼阵线的暴徒们，满是油污的衣服上逐渐沾染了血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1979_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的对手是我！混账！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯市民们","speakerId":"avg_npc_2174_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌拉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯塔尼","speakerId":"avg_4223_botany_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反抗巴普洛维奇，反抗压迫的，从来不只有我们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸声？从敌人后方那边传来的......一定是无缚者同盟在那里战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......安托沙他们在流血！同学们，前进！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒D","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人！我们快撤吧，弟兄们都顶不住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，该死，该死——这就是所谓的支援？才打了几发就没有了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十天前，这些*乌萨斯粗口*公主少爷还争先恐后地跪在我的面前，现在为什么会变成这样？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"枢密官大人，无论如何都该后撤了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再这样下去我们会被俘虏的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......放一把火断后，回到城墙上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵，不，乌萨斯会救我们的，我得尽量拖到最后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在不行，就和这些小毛头同归于尽！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2179_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我刚才去看了一圈，能够确定余下的敌人都撤到了城墙上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅！我来了，顺便说一句，后方的炸药大家也都一起搬过来了，正好能派上用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2178_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可城墙很坚固，而且我们要先去灭火，顺便收集他们没带走的炸药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2179_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太花时间了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就先灭火再谈别的，看我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯塔尼","speakerId":"avg_4223_botany_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......索尼娅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵——呵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你为什么不进来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人......我知道您的决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但城墙很坚固，他们也还没闯进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以能不能先把火柴放下？至少别让它对着引线——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那个上尉带来的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们好像也陷入了苦战，好久没传来消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人，不能再等了，按下那个通讯器按钮，呼叫火力增援吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！你懂什么？！我、我绝不能落到那个下场，我宁可——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么声音？他们在干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g9_topwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅，你想去哪？快回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的学生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是伊戈尔雕像的方向，但那些火还没有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的锤斧向下挥去。地面在哀鸣中崩裂，震荡将燃烧的油脂与残渣瞬间震飞，连带着周围的空气都被这股蛮横的力量强行排空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"失去了氧气的供给，那团原本不可一世的火舌在这一秒出现了窒息般的停滞，随即被腾起的烟尘死死压灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，是这样......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她迈出一步，鞋子踩在曾经的火海、现在的焦炭之上。\n一下、两下......飞溅的火星落在她的发梢和肩头，她在燃烧的大地上不断捶打着，仿佛在锻造一条本不存在的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2178_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把雕像往城墙那边推倒，或许能把门砸开......"},{"type":"narration","text":"人们不由自主地跟在她的身后，而这条火焰铸就的道路的尽头——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g4_blockst"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的伊戈尔大帝的雕像就矗立在那里——几乎像是倚靠在封锁区的大门口，眺望圣骏堡的最后一隅，也俯视着拖着锤斧的她。\n年轻的领袖走向了一千年前的巨人，夕阳为石头雕像戴上黄金冠冕——这位凝结着创造与苦难的历程的皇帝，正居高临下。\n她握紧了手中的锤斧，每一声呼吸都仿佛轰鸣的炉火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g9_topwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗬啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她抬起手臂——为了那些囚禁在喉咙里的声音。坚不可摧的大理石底座崩裂出一道狰狞的伤疤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2179_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2179_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家跟着索尼娅一起上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2179_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砸烂它、推倒它！圣骏堡就在我们眼前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚定的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2182_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她再次砸去——为了那些冻毙在寒夜的理想。蛛网般的裂纹爬满了帝国的基石，虚伪的威严开始哀鸣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往裂缝那里使劲，它快撑不住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚定的学生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2182_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费佳，别愣着，来搭把手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"他望着曾经巍峨挺拔、如今瑟瑟发抖的雕像，心脏随着每一声砸击而震动。\n他的手不由得也抚在了石雕之上，年轻人的呼喊在他耳边四起，紧挨着的臂膀摩擦着，隐隐传来体温。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌拉——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安保队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"枢密官大人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴普洛维奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_2158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下在上，保佑我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他呢喃着念出最后的话语时，伊戈尔雕像碎成的石块，自他头顶轰然倾落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"尘埃尚未落定，一道刺目的光射了进来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_i11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人逃出来了！“十六勇士”还在前面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓住他们，让他们为自己的罪行付出代价！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了乌萨斯！"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊戈尔的剑摔落在城墙上，石头铸就的权柄至此粉身碎骨。\n伊戈尔的拳头砸碎了枷锁，一个人影跨过废墟，接着是十个，百个......\n他们的脑海中，回荡着昨夜凛冬的呼喊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_i16"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_i12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......他们告诉你我，去做一个庸常的人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们是不是说过——只需割掉舌头，就能咀嚼涂满黄油的面包？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只需剜掉膝盖，就能换取一纸赦令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只需接一杯同伴的鲜血，就能擦亮自己的门楣与勋章？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是多么简单的道路，去当历史中的尘埃、供养大地的枯草......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，“不”，我们回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们选择善良与诚实，选择风暴与苦难。因为我们在守护自己，守护每一个应当拥有未来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，最后一次——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了乌萨斯的，不愿跪下的孩子！"},{"type":"narration","text":"一片燎原的红色，像是决堤而出的滚烫的熔岩。\n如是，乌萨斯的学生们，从苍白的冻土中破茧而出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我那一队，只有我一个人走了出来，其他人都——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啜泣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_2172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这已经是第四个讲战斗过程的证人了......怎么说的都一样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_2171_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要指望巴普洛维奇找来的混混，等上尉那边的士兵来了或许会好不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仲裁人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制情绪，先生，听证会还需要了解一些细节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仲裁人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴于......契切林上尉已经光荣殉国，但事先调查的时候，你说你了解上尉的具体战斗事迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“十六勇士”暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_2166_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们，他们杀死了所有反贼，但最后大多数人都死于城墙倒塌与爆炸——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":"avg_4224_turdus_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骗子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":"avg_4224_turdus_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们什么都没看到，凭什么这么说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仲裁人","speakerId":"avg_npc_2168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......警察，带这个孩子离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g6_blockcamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冬将军，行李都清点好了，我们得尽早离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次......有多少伤员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗组还在统计......不是所有人都撑到了现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无缚者同盟呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅，罗莎琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安托沙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么只有你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们突袭了后方，遇上一队乌萨斯军警。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g5_blockalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特维","speakerId":"avg_npc_2160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，拿着这个，捂住胸口，你不会有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神色坚定的女生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2182_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神色坚定的女生","speakerId":"avg_npc_2182_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经过了这么久吗，马特维......天好黑......"},{"type":"narration","text":"冬风吹过，泥浆凝固在她年轻的脸庞上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特维","speakerId":"avg_npc_2160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特维","speakerId":"avg_npc_2160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们装备精良，不能再这么打下去了，安——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特维","speakerId":"avg_npc_2160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来！安托沙！"},{"type":"narration","text":"安托沙抱起源石炸药悍然前冲。弩矢啸叫而过，他左腿一软，重重扑倒在泥地里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，差一点——"},{"type":"narration","text":"脚步声如鼓点迫近，他还来不及反应，怀里的源石炸药已被一只坚定的手猛地抽离。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得吗，安托沙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无缚者里，我才是身手最敏捷的那个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"举起武器吧，混蛋！你们杀不死自由——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g6_blockcamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无缚者，打倒了他们每一个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，马特维他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们能活下来，每个人都欠了他，欠了你们许多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开之前，我会找到他和其他人，向他们好好告别的，安托沙，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要。不要再说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还需要做一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打败我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅，为了走出那扇大门，你杀了巴普洛维奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你知道他有罪，他是迫害卡托加区所有人的凶手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么你为什么看不见帕夫洛的罪、乌萨斯贵族的罪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像他这样的人，那些有过之无不及的乌萨斯贵族，还有所谓的“皇帝”费奥多尔，在这个烂透了的地方飞扬跋扈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后他们就看着，看着普通人的血泪流淌......他们以腐肉为生，心安理得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想废墟下的“枢密官大人”，他可悲的人生，终于在死亡的时候回馈给了所有被压迫的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的毁灭本身就能带来我所要的答案，带给乌萨斯从头至尾的毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在审视每一个个体，用他们的身份来作为处刑的依据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而摧毁只是一种手段，有的时候它或许有用处，但如果它不能团结起更多的人，那么一切都没有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是这种审时度势......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你留下他们，留下腐朽的思想与路径，迟早有一天，他们那“更好的生活”会收买你的朋友，收买你的后继者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，你觉得依靠杀戮与摧毁，就能在一夜之间遏制那些思想，铲除一切不公？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了一个没有到来的预言，我们不去成为一个保护自己的团体，而是任凭各自的纯粹心灵，去迎接乌萨斯的火炮与战舰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不必多说了，索尼娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么时候，学会了说教......决斗吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受了很重的伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还在幻想新的秩序，那就从我的尸体上，走出你的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安托沙，你是觉得只有如此才能达到自己的理想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是因为，目睹同伴们在你的面前牺牲，所以你决心追求一场诗意的死亡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解，此时此刻你不愿独活......可是安托沙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从始至终，你都在夸大毁灭的价值，你自以为只要我杀了你就是在为某种未来奠基。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会认同这种愚蠢的愿景，葬送性命绝不可能为理想增色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凛冬","speakerId":"avg_1051_headb2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须要去找到他们了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，索尼娅，你不能走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为只有你一个人为无缚者难过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要再伤害他们了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到此为止吧，安托沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的理想，或许再加上你自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是他们所有人牺牲的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是铁锈的气味又翻涌上了嘴角，他今天第二次品尝到了这种充满悔恨的滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们，你们在干什么？让我进去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳？为什么会这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是最快的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们也需要时间，去埋葬一些朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g6_blockcamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌克西克......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":"avg_4224_turdus_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安托沙，我在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":"avg_4224_turdus_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么流了这么多血？我马上给你包扎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":"avg_4224_turdus_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌克西克","speakerId":"avg_4224_turdus_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我醒来的时候就在索尼娅的营地里了，听他们说，是马特维昨晚把我送过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安托沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些信，还在你的包里吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g2_sjbstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_2171_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝陛下！皇帝陛下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_2171_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您受惊了，我们确认消息后，第一时间召集了近卫军——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？打算让他们干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_2171_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是肃清那些反贼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“反贼”，说的是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_2171_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1984_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论什么事，先回到宫里再说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下，我扶您上车！"},{"type":"narration","text":"不远处的黑色载具里铺着红色的绒毯，费奥多尔仿佛已经闻到了熟悉的香薰。\n他顿了顿，向前走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"维特，告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坚持了二十多年，那片火海就是我们的成果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费奥多尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，会是这种成果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍从","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"议长大人，陛下如果这么走回去，会让那些市民都看到这副打扮的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让他走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是陛下的愿望......"},{"type":"narration","text":"费奥多尔在这座城市住了数十年，却是第一次在这条街道上行走。\n雪花从他脸上划过——无论落在废墟还是皇宫，都是同样地冰冷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
